# Vercel builds only `cloud/` (the project's Root Directory), so everything the
# Rust workspace needs is upload weight for a build that will not read it.
#
# Kept deliberately explicit rather than a bare `*` + negation: a future
# contributor adding a second deployable directory should have to think about
# it, not discover that it was silently excluded.
/target
/crates
/deploy
/.git
/.github
/.claude
*.png
*.log
Cargo.lock
Cargo.toml
